<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">MAGIQ: A Post-Quantum Multi-Agentic AI Governance System with Provable Security</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Sepideh Avizeh
