(US-West, US-East, EU, Asia) under varying <math id="S6.F7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S6.F7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m=100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m=100</annotation></semantics></math> requests between <math id="S6.F7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{I}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{I}</annotation></semantics></math>  and
<math id="S6.F7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{R}</annotation></semantics></math>. Shaded regions reflect the variability in overhead attributable
to differences in agent location worldwide.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
